{"4645630": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mansion of Relics", "steam_appid": 4645630, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a multi-perspective RPG puzzle game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This game currently supports Simplified Chinese only！！！</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >According to rumors, Field Manor at No. 46 Qingqian Town has been deserted ever since a bizarre incident occurred there a few years ago. However, after years of silence, several people of different identities have received mysterious invitations from the manor. Who is behind this, and what is their true intention?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4645630/extras/90216fc606b22910edf71d302d93f49b.avif?t=1777796264\" width=1296 height=441 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game: You will experience the story from a first-person perspective, alternating between the individual storylines of four characters within the same timeline (some characters include flashbacks to their pasts), their intertwined conflicts and psychological changes, as well as the firsthand past experiences of another character. By piecing together clues from various objects in the manor, you will uncover the only truth woven between the past and the present.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4645630/extras/b2a89a6899c21b8c87f9eb32b19b2065.avif?t=1777796264\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4645630/extras_big/b2a89a6899c21b8c87f9eb32b19b2065.webp?t=1777796264 width=1560 height=2080 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"